# Valgrind suppressions for the CTOL matrix (`meson/matrix.sh`, config: valgrind).
#
# Scope every suppression to a third-party or system library. A suppression
# that can match first-party code hides the exact defects the gate exists to
# catch (the gate is only as honest as its suppressions).
#
# Example (uncomment and adapt to your vendored/system libraries):
# {
#    mylib_cond
#    Memcheck:Cond
#    obj:*/libmylib.so*
# }
